Z||000000||Haze_Performance||04-18-2001||03:53 PM||||Well I picked up my new '88 Formula/GT/Ferrari/Vette Last Friday. So far so good. I took it easy for a few days. (Had to get used to driving stick again) On the way home last night. (2:00am) A Hyped up new Mazda Miata pulled up next to me. Well I had to give it a try.... We took off from the light and I just walked away from him. At the 1/4 mile I was over 5 cars ahead of him. His big a$$ coffee can exhausts were screaming!!! Ohhhh Yeaaa My first kill...(BRING ON THE MR2'S) lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">  </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A>||||reg||14
